  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left[\\frac{n h}{2 \\pi q B}\\right]$<br />where $n$ and $2 \\pi$ dimensionless quantity<br />So, $[h]=[m v r]$<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />\\mid q B] &=\\left[\\frac{q v B}{v}\\right]=\\left[\\frac{F}{v}\\right] \\\\<br />\\therefore \\quad\\left[\\frac{m v r}{F / v}\\right] &=\\frac{[m v r][v]}{[F]} \\\\<br />&=\\left[\\frac{\\left[m v^{2} r\\right]}{r}\\right]=\\left[r^{2}\\right\\}=\\text { Area }<br />\\end{aligned}$",
